  "interpretation_guard": "The replay uses real BGE-M3 embeddings, the real Neo4j kg-v1 vector index, and frozen production KG Cypher templates with query arguments taken from preselected real agent traces. search_literature_multiview is replayed as its vector-backed query set and does not reconstruct the production RRF/graph merge; therefore this experiment evaluates runtime backing-resource behavior and query-path timing, not retrieval-quality equivalence to the full production hybrid retriever. Local screening/report calls and LLM time are excluded. The Neo4j driver and pool are retained across calls under CWSR; every query creates and closes its own session in both policies, matching the root KG/RAG service lifecycle. Driver initializations and session creations are reported separately."
